WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.700
In taking upon herself for more than 20 years the role of champion of a united Europe,

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.360
France has always had as her essential aim the service of peace.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.900
A united Europe was not achieved, and we had war.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Europe will not be made all at once, or according to a single plan.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:33.000
It will be built through concrete achievements which first create a de facto solidarity.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:40.000
The French Government proposes that Franco-German production of coal and steel as a whole be placed

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
under a common High Authority.

